# Central pinned refs for in-lab Paintbot player builds.
#
# One source of truth so builds are reproducible. Sourced by tools/build_player.sh.

# Canonical deployed version reviewed against this lab. Git history preserves
# the previous version/ref pair, so this file is also the game-sync ledger.
PAINTBOT_GAME_VERSION=0.7.211
# The coworld-ctf game commit stencil's sim-rule constants were derived from
# and whose pinned Nim dependency graph builds the native player. This must be a
# full immutable SHA: Docker fetches that revision's nimby.lock directly. Canonical
# Paintbot 0.7.211 resolved to this source on 2026-08-07. GameVersion 41
# adds the visible grenade-barrage marker and endgame barrage while retaining
# continuous five-brad turret aim; its 1v1 variant allocates two full
# eight-agent teams. The campaign scheduler separately assigns those seats
# 7+7+1+1 across captains and allies. Stencil's stateful Sprite-v1 client
# consumes the retained placement stream directly.
PAINTBOT_GAME_REF=9dedac0ed6011aeca92bf2c6403b0e70c955f461
